From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 02:58:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Added ISO dates to the KEV and EPSS report keys

Report templates can compare kev_due_date_iso, due_date_iso, date_added_iso and
score_date_iso as text whatever the server's DATE_FORMAT is. The docs for
extract_cves now warn that it copies example CVE IDs into findings.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JeRCvM2shAtegxe489Vfvx
